      ],
      "en": "Our soul has escaped like a bird out of the fowler’s snare. The snare is broken, and we have escaped.",
      "ko": "우리 혼이 새가 사냥군의 올무에서 벗어남 같이 되었나니 올무가 끊어지므로 우리가 벗어났도다",
      "source_text_hash": "9ccfc5c4f824f9dc9959732e16f2fb5dffef163ab85d209ee7a3a49b53642944",
      "translation_text_hash": "c6c331e2c1be6055343d26da6e1d552a6f4c232592f0402e7ca8c6902b01e281",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
